X-WR-CALNAME:Shift Worker Wake-Up Routine 30 min (any hour)
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Shift Wake-Up Routine 30 min: water\, workout\, shower\, meal\, sh
 ift check
DTSTART:20261005T060000
DTEND:20261005T063000
DTSTAMP:20261018T120000Z
UID:dade4759295a7140c71b@celestialprintcanada
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY
DESCRIPTION:1. Wake + water + bright light (2 min) - Turn on bright lights
  right away\, whatever the hour. Drink water.\n2. Workout (10 min) - 10-mi
 n no-equipment circuit: 2 rounds of 45s on/15s off: marching or jogging in
  place\, squats\, wall or knee push-ups\, glute bridges\, plank (knees ok)
 .\n3. Shower + uniform (8 min) - Uniform and bag laid out before you slept
 .\n4. First meal (8 min) - Count it as breakfast\, whatever the clock says
 . Pack your shift snacks.\n5. Shift check (2 min) - Badge\, keys\, charger
 \, water bottle\, meals.\n\nDefault start: 6:00 AM. Set it to the time you
  usually wake up for a shift. open the event\, tap Edit\, change the start
  time\, then choose 'Save for Future Events' (iPhone) or 'This and followi
 ng events' (Google). Not medical advice. Check with your doctor before sta
 rting a new exercise routine. CelestialPrintCanada
